pluto-lunar (0.0~git20260904.d951918+dfsg-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * New upstream version 0.0~git20260904.d951918+dfsg
  * d/control: Bump Standards-Version to 4.7.4 (no changes needed)
  * d/control: Switch to debhelper-compat (= 13), drop debian/compat
  * d/control: Drop redundant Priority: optional field
  * d/control: Set Section: libdevel for libpluto-lunar-dev
  * d/rules: Drop -Wl,--as-needed linker flag, no longer needed since
    Bullseye
  * d/pluto-lunar.dirs: Drop empty usr/bin directory
  * d/copyright: Advertise repackaging with +dfsg version suffix, as
    Files-Excluded is used
  * d/upstream/metadata: Add
  * Move binaries from /usr/lib/pluto/lunar to /usr/libexec/pluto/lunar,
    per FHS 3.0 and Debian Policy 4.1.5 (executables don't belong under
    /usr/lib), matching the same move done in pluto-jpl-eph
  * Add lintian override for false-positive "Lon"/"lon" spelling checks

